":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOPasswordInput"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","text":"Layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Passwords input is based on several configurable UI elements:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"label","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the input."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"placeholder","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":":  A prefix is not common and is discouraged in a Password Input component. In very specific cases, it can provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context or format requirements (e.g., “DEV-” for test accounts, “admin-” as a pattern to define an admin password)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"lock icon","type":"text"}]},{"text":": it helps to reinforce the security context.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the password field.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Outlined style","anchor":"Outlined-style"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Your password\", password: $password, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable from a bundle","   MISOPasswordInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"password_label\"), bundle: Bundle.module, password: $password)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Rounded layout","anchor":"Rounded-layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the"},{"code":" MISOTextInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", rounded corners can be enabled or disabled using the "},{"code":"hasRoundedTextInputs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in your theme configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Status","level":2,"anchor":"Status","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As "},{"code":"MISOPasswordInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is based on the","type":"text"},{"code":" MISOTextInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", all the status are the same and have the same behavior available here ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextInput.Status","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Rich-text","text":"Rich text","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The password to display and edit","    @State var password: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ A basic password input with label","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password)","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon and helper text to more context","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, lockIcon: true, helperText: \"Your password must be between 8 and 20 characters long.\")","","    \/\/ Password with prefix","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, prefix: \"CORP-\")","","    \/\/ Make password visible","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, isHiddenPassword: .constant(false))"]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.3.1 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 1.2.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misopasswordinput"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOPasswordInput","kind":"i